# The operator ClusterRole gains what the downstream TLS support in
# images/redis-operator/patches/tls.diff actually calls, and nothing else.
#
# Upstream v3.3.5 grants `get` on Secrets, because the unpatched operator only
# reads a Secret someone else wrote. The patched operator also publishes the
# CA-only Secret named by spec.tls.caCertSecretName, and Create, Get and Update
# are every Secret call in the patched source (service/k8s/secret.go). It
# addresses the Secret by name, so there is no list and no watch, and nothing
# patches or deletes.
#
# cert-manager Certificates are deliberately not granted: the operator manages
# one only under spec.tls.certManager, a mode packages/apps/redis never sets —
# it always supplies spec.tls.certificateSecret. The rationale sits as a comment
# at the rule site so a re-vendor review reads the absence as a decision.
--- a/charts/redis-operator/templates/service-account.yaml
+++ b/charts/redis-operator/templates/service-account.yaml
@@ -68,12 +68,29 @@
       - patch
       - update
       - watch
+  # Downstream TLS patch, carried as patches/rbac-tls.diff: charts/ is discarded
+  # by `make update`, so widen or narrow this through the patch, not here.
+  #
+  # Upstream v3.3.5 needs `get` alone, because the unpatched operator only reads
+  # a Secret someone else wrote. The patched operator also publishes the CA-only
+  # Secret named by spec.tls.caCertSecretName. Create, Get and Update are every
+  # Secret call the patched source makes (service/k8s/secret.go): it addresses
+  # the Secret by name, so nothing lists or watches, and nothing patches.
+  #
+  # cert-manager Certificates are deliberately not granted. The operator manages
+  # a Certificate only under spec.tls.certManager, and packages/apps/redis pins
+  # the other mode: it always sets spec.tls.certificateSecret and never
+  # certManager, so that code is unreachable as this platform ships it. Setting
+  # certManager on a RedisFailover therefore fails with a 403 until this rule
+  # gains cert-manager.io/certificates with create, get and update.
   - apiGroups:
       - ""
     resources:
       - secrets
     verbs:
-      - "get"
+      - create
+      - get
+      - update
   - apiGroups:
       - apps
     resources:
